[{"title":"春思曲","author":"魏学礼","text":"别意落凄枝，闲怀写愁叶。\n缄怨投素鳞，衔情卷故箧。\n误嫁游侠郎，弃置薄命妾。\n香缕罗衣襞不开，玉摇宝钗寒自叠。\n衾将空半冷鸳鸯，梦逐飘飖拆胡蝶。\n川长不得渡，春花惊已暮。\n为叹朱颜不待秋，独持皓齿终成妒。\n舞腰倚柱裛啼妆，歌颊低灯望归路。\n魂飞在他乡，掩袂泣河梁。\n笛边闻《折柳》，琴里咽《求凰》。\n纷心堕镜红已歇，芳愿消花弱自伤。\n明月两悬思，黄沙孤断肠。\n饮马长城窟，结客少年场。\n每命湘灵鼓瑶瑟，复闻秦女卷衣裳。\n故情摇落空流水，哀鸿单宿湘蒲里。\n始从木末送芙蓉，又见溪旁候桃李。\n桃李映人清，芙蓉摘未成。\n青松委萝壑，白露掩芜城。\n芜城一去三千里，萝壑秋寒殊未已。\n盘龙宝镜网蜘蛛，孔雀金屏隔罗绮。\n金屏宝镜不可期，孔雀盘龙有所思。\n迢递关河吹暮雪，萧条庭户起凉飔。\n汉王台前花似绣，隋家堤畔柳如丝。\n已遣轻车迎日逐，更驱枭骑斩屠耆。\n李广军中无部伍，昭君马上作阏氏。\n年年边徼休乘障，处处铙歌听凯辞，但使金微长息战，与君朝夕共裤麋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭台怨二首 其一","author":"魏学礼","text":"翠袖辞金殿，青苔闭紫宫。\n香寒罗帐晓，春歇玉阶空。\n艳态消花上，悲情落管中。\n君王恩未薄，妾梦向来同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭台怨二首 其二","author":"魏学礼","text":"别馆芙蓉暗，闲房翡翠寒。\n漏催千夜尽，宫锁一春残。\n芳岁惊流水，容华泣楚兰。\n谁怜愁坐意，新月在楼端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和章宪副艳诗","author":"魏学礼","text":"翠馆云楼花欲晴，新妆初就晓鸾惊。\n莫愁艇子知何处，露湿衣香到月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"魏学礼","text":"烟中一叶采莲舟，两岸香风正早秋。\n瞥见江南明月上，玉箫吹断紫云愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5423,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发湘潭","author":"章美中","text":"凌晨陟平麓，野色眷行旅。\n娟娟千林花，犹含夜来雨。\n山深云不流，春去禽自语。\n景物各有适，吾道岂踽踽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5424,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮相思","author":"章美中","text":"征帆日已远，回波不相待。\n暝色孤峰来，故乡何处在。\n日淡墟里烟，云尽天边海。\n如何暮相思，坐令鬓容改。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5425,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"毗陵道中遇司勋皇甫子循舟有诗相贻奉答","author":"章美中","text":"三月轻风桃李阴，春城吹入客愁深。\n扁舟未逐五湖去，华发空随双鬓侵。\n芳草东归故园色，江流北转逐臣心。\n烟波日暮知何处，天畔疏峰相对吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5426,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪怀二首 其一","author":"章士雅","text":"鸟声啼散一帘花，遥忆春风怨岁华。\n何事半生能薄幸，绿杨深处即为家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5427,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪怀二首 其二","author":"章士雅","text":"江城二月客衣单，况是春风十日寒。\n东国梅花吹欲尽，不须横笛倚朱栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5428,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晚二首 其一","author":"章士雅","text":"春望亦堪怜，平芜远接天。\n不禁双燕子，飞出落花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5429,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晚二首 其二","author":"章士雅","text":"春雨过前溪，垂杨树树低。\n绿窗人不语，惟有晓莺啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5430,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词","author":"章士雅","text":"长淮渡头杨柳春，长淮市上酒旗新。\n系船沽酒折杨柳，还是去年西渡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"章士雅","text":"秋雨秋风入暮天，愁心独与片帆悬。\n总教作客非千里，堪笑为郎已六年。\n芦叶半黄风破岸，稻花全白水平田。\n栖迟岁月怜今昔，《梁父》孤吟倍黯然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆小园花事","author":"章士雅","text":"天南人去二三月，小苑花飞五六枝。\n孤阁自开巢乳燕，疏帘不卷驻游丝。\n园蔬未作愁中供，芳草还虚梦里诗。\n最忆东邻夜吹笛，一声遥在月明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别思","author":"章士雅","text":"东方千骑去如云，最有罗敷念使君。\n晓镜疏花看寂寞，夜香明月坐氤氲。\n门前细雨新桃浪，陌上和风旧燕群。\n莫道朝来无锦字，落红飞处半回文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺思","author":"顾大典","text":"朝日斜照户，垂杨低拂床。\n新篁未解箨，幽兰已谢芳。\n桑蛾齐绕树，海燕竞窥梁。\n玉箸流残粉，金炉冷夕香。\n罗衾空有梦，无信往辽阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡黄河","author":"顾大典","text":"疲马日投北，间关意若何。\n星霜催短鬓，风雨渡长河。\n远道逢人少，归心入梦多。\n未能逃世网，微尚竟蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟夜忆郡斋眺阁","author":"顾大典","text":"舟移泽国暮烟长，望入沧波思渺茫。\n遥忆郡斋清绝处，万山孤阁夜焚香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月十七夜与周国雍话旧","author":"顾大典","text":"霜满蒹葭月满地，断烟疏树影参差。\n天涯莫道相逢易，昨岁今宵是别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅下吹笛","author":"顾大典","text":"红筵绿酒扑寒香，树树梅花压粉墙。\n忽见玉鳞飞夜月，自吹长笛坐胡床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈少卿席上有赠","author":"顾大典","text":"曾向毗陵怨别离，十年重见不胜悲。\n相看共有江州泪，湿尽青衫是此时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居杂兴","author":"顾大典","text":"坐来黄叶满渔矶，小阁疏灯对掩扉。\n竹覆古墙经雨暗，夜分时复见萤飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重登虎丘","author":"顾大典","text":"剑壑秋风起暮烟，寒泉落木自依然。\n翻因解组重来日，悔别青山二十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北归客至述怀","author":"周天球","text":"脱迹风尘少自宽，对君杯酒话更阑。\n去天尺五终非近，行路寻常总是难。\n解佩尚余孤剑在，探囊不问一钱看。\n泰阶星斗时时合，彩笔于今未易干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵七夕赠皇甫司勋","author":"周天球","text":"片雨明河拭，双星阁道临。\n论欢天上别，惊候旅中深。\n夕吹催飞藿，商声动早砧。\n城南倦游客，同折此时心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斗鸡图","author":"周天球","text":"英年曾入斗鸡场，金距狸膏事已荒。\n惟有雄心忘未得，披图犹自问低昂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋长干曲三首 其一","author":"周天球","text":"内桥南走是长干，十里平铺白玉寒。\n踏尽马蹄尘不动，半窗明月此中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋长干曲三首 其二","author":"周天球","text":"花灯百队走儿童，尽道仙娥降月中。\n纵是霓裳看不见，白毫光里度香风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋长干曲三首 其三","author":"周天球","text":"玉笙低引紫箫长，不许商音断客肠。\n听到月斜才入破，飞来七十二鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画杂花","author":"钱谷","text":"淡白轻黄各斗奇，嫩红殷紫总芳菲。\n上林春色原无赖，不断生香惹客衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仕女观流水小景","author":"陆治","text":"银塘秋水玉娟娟，霜叶漂红去渺然。\n几欲题诗寄辽海，只应流水到君边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倦绣","author":"陆治","text":"洞房深锁碧窗纱，玉树阶前护翠霞。\n移得绣床浑不倚，金针愁刺并头花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画丫兰","author":"陆治","text":"玉戟棱棱应节分，枝枝柔玉纫香云。\n凝妆拟待三更月，露染生绡六幅裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜登阊门城楼","author":"张本","text":"月白三吴晚，风清八月秋。\n芙蓉照江国，蟋蟀上城楼。\n海思飞云乱，乡心落叶愁。\n忽闻黄鹤笛，清夜重淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山斋秋夜","author":"张本","text":"洞庭秋清夜何寂，蓬鬓萧萧枫叶村。\n白云满几月在牖，碧水浮阶花映门。\n袖中野况空诗草，醉里家山污酒痕。\n牢落空江谁吊古，灵胥还有未招魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲步","author":"顾祖辰","text":"僻径无车马，沿流看捕鱼。\n断桥疏雨过，古木春风余。\n片语款邻曲，孤怀仍索居。\n悠然真意在，花竹傲窗虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜步","author":"顾祖辰","text":"黄昏门未掩，偃蹇倚孤松。\n正见水中月，遥闻风外钟。\n村虚春寂寂，烟远树重重。\n只觉幽怀惬，微吟送短筇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独立","author":"顾祖辰","text":"久病江湖老，长依七尺筇。\n年光变燕雀，岩壑自云松。\n独立深遐思，微吟迟晚容。\n邻翁隔春水，贳酒漫相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步","author":"顾祖辰","text":"风疏门柳薄，日落暝烟浓。\n向树鸟群乱，隔溪山数重。\n病闲吟短句，衰怯倚枯筇。\n更有幽深意，寒流来暮钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨过有怀山中素友","author":"顾祖辰","text":"雨过一天碧，风来满鬓凉。\n余酣消枕簟，长病积年光。\n静爱蛛丝巧，闲多燕子忙。\n有怀赋招隐，丛桂小山芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后酌邻翁","author":"顾祖辰","text":"江平新雨过，林阙晚山微。\n采绿仍驱牧，看云方掩扉。\n因知农事暇，远贳村醪归。\n秉烛招比邻，相酌愿无违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客去夜坐","author":"顾祖辰","text":"鸟宿门前树，岚沉水上山。\n忽闻邻犬吠，知是渔舟还。\n老病青畦废，长贫白首闲。\n意中人去远，寂寞道书间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中有怀周二韬叔","author":"顾祖辰","text":"向夕开窗坐，檀栾竹色多。\n清虚酬破研，闲寂养沉疴。\n山远岚将暝，春残莺懒过。\n长安有游子，何处醉颜酡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过题润泉山房","author":"顾祖辰","text":"翠微支遁隐，新构习清虚。\n施食来山鸟，翻经击木鱼。\n花倾知景夕，月上属凉初。\n肯借一椽隙，相容半榻于。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屈原庙","author":"梁辰鱼","text":"寒云掩映庙堂门，旅客秋来荐水蘩。\n山鬼暗吹青殿火，灵儿昼舞白霓幡。\n龙舆已逐蜂头梦，鱼腹空埋水底魂。\n斑竹丛丛杂芳杜，鹧鸪飞处欲黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石矶吊李太白","author":"梁辰鱼","text":"停桡矶下奠椒觞，草木犹闻翰墨香。\n飞燕已辞青琐闼，长鲸自上白云乡。\n他年有梦游天姥，此夕无魂到夜郎。\n西望长安漫惆怅，金銮春殿久荒凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纨扇","author":"梁辰鱼","text":"朝来两蛱蝶，分宿花房雨。\n纨扇亦多情，拂尔双飞去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王卿","author":"梁辰鱼","text":"绛罗裙软醉榴花，午夜高楼月倍嘉。\n曲罢暗香人不识，半槽余暖在琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏蕙","author":"梁辰鱼","text":"泪痕点滴锦花浮，几载抛梭织未休。\n愿得璇图似夫婿，残丝断处认回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌","author":"陆文组","text":"染蘖作侬衾，持冰置侬枕。\n城乌夜夜啼，苦寒不成寝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人寄书","author":"陆文组","text":"秋梦无凭客路遥，尺书封寄恨迢迢。\n吴绫不及桃花纸，颜色都从别后消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花诗次文徵仲韵二首 其一","author":"朱承爵","text":"雨雨风风太惨情，眼前红白霎时盈。\n骎寻紫燕穿香户，寂寞红鹃哭锦城。\n短梦一场春事散，好怀三月客愁轻。\n明朝急就东园醉，试取残诗补得成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花诗次文徵仲韵二首 其二","author":"朱承爵","text":"少妇含情半自伤，有丹疑可驻春光。\n樽前好事风前影，雨底残脂泪底妆。\n倩此落霞烘老圃，趁他飞絮绕横塘。\n珠帘锦瑟南朝怨，乐府谁翻字字香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花园子","author":"陈凤","text":"当年内苑花如绮，万树红云日边倚。\n监使惟承巡幸欢，诛求那惜花园子。\n别有朱门令尤急，绿衣怒叱青衣执。\n春风惨惨白日寒，愁把花枝对花泣。\n祇今圣主罢游畋，诏书屡却黄龙船。\n岁时虽有上林役，种植还堪助衣食。\n君不见玄明宫少阳院，秋雨霏霏秋草遍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勾曲道中早行","author":"陈凤","text":"京国秋风急，驱车还晓行。\n石林清露滴，野水白烟生。\n逾坂迟童仆，问程称弟兄。\n丹霞开曙色，前馆正鸡声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"陈凤","text":"长风吹古堞，落木下沧波。\n孤月动寒幌，暮烟生碧萝。\n客怀闻雁急，人语入村多。\n又宿秋江上，依然旧钓蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中客至","author":"陈凤","text":"新水柴门涨碧沙，孤村烟树隐渔家。\n客来湖上偏逢雨，春到江南又见花。\n沽酒隔邻传小瓮，打鱼深夜出枯槎。\n浮生莫遣浮名误，醉里还惊两鬓华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄洛阳李五秀才","author":"赵纲","text":"未得吴公荐，空怜贾谊才。\n年年三月里，相忆看花来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西郊","author":"赵纲","text":"山关启翠微，霜钟自晨夕。\n花里一僧来，泠泠振金策。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐词","author":"徐定夫","text":"禁门秋草雨中生，睡醒芙蓉小帐清。\n几日内庭宣唤少，紫薇花底学吹笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡排市","author":"范言","text":"马怯千村雨，帆开五两风。\n江山淹去住，踪迹任西东。\n树深哀猿里，孤城画角中。\n自深羁旅思，宁为酒杯空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逆浪船","author":"范言","text":"君不见李广难封侯，黄杨厄闰年。\n黄杨厄闰短复短，白头李广徒称贤。\n又不见章台柳枝高拂辇，今日青青明日剪。\n淮阴金印大如斗，鸟尽弓藏烹猎狗。\n樯乌高扬白马驰，中流失瓠知不知。\n前途利钝吾何有，请君试酌松陵酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬贾实斋宪副","author":"范言","text":"水暖跃春鱼，山晴照客居。\n菰蒲淮水际，松桧汉年余。\n酒熟云安市，田荒邺下渠。\n矫儿胜笔研，涂抹老夫书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"范言","text":"谁开湖上阁，独对晚来曛。\n莺语排花出，潮声带雨分。\n遥看邻牧散，闲与海鸥群。\n自笑江干老，悠然卧白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画眉","author":"范言","text":"宝髻蓬松锦帐垂，晓晴慵起斗花枝。\n浓妆未必能承宠，何事幽禽唤画眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖闻笛","author":"徐?","text":"月白霜寒客梦醒，笛声迥出柳洲亭。\n莫教吹过孤山去，风里梅花不耐听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏霖行","author":"吴世忠","text":"女娲之墓波面悬，无人力补东南天。\n雷公玉女不知天已漏，复鸣天鼓大笑于帝前。\n江翻海倒地无轴，六鳌飞上层霄颠。\n遂令万姓赤子为鱼鳖，三山五岳俱回旋。\n郡国嗷嗷诉愁苦，九龙九龙尔无侮。\n吾欲诛九龙，醢之充我一杯脯。\n大声叫帝阍，又恐阍者怒。\n心知事不济，反锁卧环堵。\n即今一月仍滂沱，太阴犹离毕之阿。\n农人预愁耳生禾，百草烂死讵足多。\n丰年之望已蹉跎，霖乎霖乎奈尔何！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌风台","author":"吴世忠","text":"君王昼游日，壮士俱锦衣。\n犹怜沛父老，争睹汉旌旗。\n汤沐开新邑，风云慑旧威。\n祇应千岁后，魂绕故乡飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行二首 其一","author":"吴世忠","text":"呼白新夸好手身，望尘星散渔阳滨。\n亦知赌胜轻七尺，不是金盘一掷人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]